ThreeIsland_House3_Text_WantedToLiveSomewhereQuiet::
    .string "I bought this house because I\n"
    .string "wanted to live somewhere quiet.\p"
    .string "Today, I think I'll go out fishing.$"

ThreeIsland_House3_Text_IGrowHoennBerries::
    .string "…But between you and me, I really\n"
    .string "came here for the soil.\p"
    .string "I'm from HOENN, you see. KANTO's\n"
    .string "soil is too poor for our BERRIES.\p"
    .string "But they grow well out back, by\n"
    .string "the BERRY FOREST.\p"
    .string "They make a POKéMON friendly, but\n"
    .string "they lower its base stats.\p"
    .string "I'll trade some for BERRY POWDER\n"
    .string "or MUSHROOMS.\p"
    .string "Would you like some?$"

ThreeIsland_House3_Text_WhichBerry::
    .string "Which BERRY would you like?$"

ThreeIsland_House3_Text_HowWillYouPay::
    .string "A {STR_VAR_1} for 100 POWDER\n"
    .string "or a TINYMUSHROOM…\p"
    .string "Or five for a BIGMUSHROOM!\n"
    .string "How would you like to pay?$"

ThreeIsland_House3_Text_AnythingElse::
    .string "Would you like any other BERRIES?$"

ThreeIsland_House3_Text_TakeGoodCare::
    .string "Please take good care of them.$"

ThreeIsland_House3_Text_NotEnoughPowder::
    .string "Oh, you don't have enough BERRY\n"
    .string "POWDER.$"

ThreeIsland_House3_Text_YouDontHaveAny::
    .string "Oh, you don't have any\n"
    .string "{STR_VAR_2}.$"

ThreeIsland_House3_Text_NoRoomForBerries::
    .string "Oh, your BERRY POUCH has no room\n"
    .string "for them.$"

ThreeIsland_House3_Text_EnjoyingTheQuiet::
    .string "Oh, all right. I'll be here,\n"
    .string "enjoying the quiet.$"

